{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgecUi5rTrUZWNzvDf4Hk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X5KPK3XE8cXQyZSna3FC6S","name":"mcp__basic-memory__bm_write","input":{"project":"main","directory":"schemas","title":"Task","note_type":"schema","content":"# Task\n\nA **Task** is work-in-progress tracked as a note, so it survives context\ncompaction and shows up in the next session's brief. This schema is the same one\nthe framework-agnostic [`memory-tasks`](https://github.com/basicmachines-co/basic-memory/tree/main/skills/memory-tasks)\nskill defines — kept identical here so the plugin and the skill agree on the\nshape. For the full task workflow (creating, updating, completing), use that\nskill.\n\nTasks are found by the SessionStart hook via structured recall:\n`bm_search(filters={\"type\": \"task\", \"status\": \"active\"})`.\n\n## Frontmatter vs observations\n\nPut queryable fields (`status`, `priority`, `current_step`) in frontmatter so\n`filters` can find them, and mirror them as `- [status] active`\nobservations so `bm_schema(command=\"validate\")` sees them. `note_type=\"Task\"` is stored as\nlowercase `task` in frontmatter, so search with `note_types=[\"task\"]`.\nValidation is `warn` — advisory, never blocking.\n","metadata":{"entity":"Task","version":1,"schema":{"description":"string, what needs to be done","status?(enum, current state)":["active","blocked","done","abandoned"],"assigned_to?":"string, who is working on this","steps?(array)":"string, ordered steps to complete","current_step?":"integer, which step number we're on (1-indexed)","context?":"string, key context needed to resume after memory loss","started?":"string, when work began","completed?":"string, when work finished","blockers?(array)":"string, what's preventing progress","parent_task?":"Task, parent task if this is a subtask"},"settings":{"validation":"warn"}}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":361,"cache_read_input_tokens":32835,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":361},"output_tokens":46,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffed382d-41e2-4f55-a8c1-16d17210df1d","uuid":"fea5d192-8e4d-4da7-924a-8f4c575f3ebb","timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:57:21.511Z","request_id":"req_011CgecUhsTTe7LJKkhM9Xma","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01X5KPK3XE8cXQyZSna3FC6S","display_name":"Write note","server_display_name":"Basic Memory","tool_name":"bm_write"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X5KPK3XE8cXQyZSna3FC6S","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: main/schemas/task\\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d52b7fbafa73cfa26caa88a62a24861c05b4b9fa7b\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='main')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='main')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffed382d-41e2-4f55-a8c1-16d17210df1d","uuid":"f9654bcd-9e85-434e-816b-53268ef10b45","timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:57:21.757Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: main/schemas/task\\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d52b7fbafa73cfa26caa88a62a24861c05b4b9fa7b\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='main')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='main')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Basic Memory","version":"4.1.3"},"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"Created schemas/Task.md\ntitle: Task\npermalink: main/schemas/task\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d5