{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgecZNvKc8GGYHDfDCGxu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up. I ran a few things differently from the plan, and the proactive-capture behavior needs a new session.\n\n- **Project:** I used `main`, the only existing project, as `primaryProject`. Creating a new `ms` project failed because its path sits inside `main`'s directory (`~/basic-memory`), and Basic Memory doesn't allow nested projects. If you'd rather have a separate `ms` project, it would need a path outside that tree.\n- **Profile:** it's a coding setup with `repository: \"ms\"`. I used the directory name because there's no git remote.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision, and Task into `main`/`schemas/`, since none existed. The frontmatter is stored as nested YAML, not as strings.\n- **Placement:** the project was empty, so I suggested a light starting layout (`specs/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `sessions/`, `bm-remember/`) and saved it in `placementConventions`. No folders were created.\n- **Settings:** these are in `.claude/settings.local.json` (personal, not committed). The output style is `basic-memory`.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally with `npx skills add`. This repo isn't the skills' source, so there was nothing to overwrite.\n- **Smoke test:** the open-decision query ran cleanly with 0 results. The schema query returned all three schemas.\n- **Hook status:**\n  - It found the settings and reports project `main`, profile `coding`, and capture events on.\n  - The shared inbox holds 1 pending envelope and has never been flushed.\n  - It reports \"checkpoint on compact: off\". I set `preCompactCapture` to `\"extractive\"`, so the PreCompact checkpoint may not be active. I didn't investigate why.\n\nRecall works now. Restart the session to activate the proactive-capture behavior, since the output style is fixed at session start.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":39410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":481},"output_tokens":686,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffed382d-41e2-4f55-a8c1-16d17210df1d","uuid":"6228089f-ef1d-4bba-a0ad-ba0572248d4d","timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:58:17.372Z","request_id":"req_011CgecZNayHZr8H4kSHuN23"}
